{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What will your waifu do? </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Watch you while you work, changing poses and expressions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sit, lie or stand next to you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Affectionately address you by name</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dance and show cute tricks at your request</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Greeting you in the morning, supporting you in difficult moments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can have up to 5 waifus at once!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What to do with waifu?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Talk to her and share your thoughts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Give her money for personal things</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Let her rest and recover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ask her to dance when you want some warmth and comfort</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Waifu customization  </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 ready-made models to choose from</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ability to upload your own VRM model</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 voiceovers to choose from (Japanese and Chinese voices)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10 headwear options</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uploading your own headwear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 waifu character types to choose from with the ability to add your own via promt</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Support Workshop - share and download content from other users</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More than 30 animations for live and realistic communication</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3642810?t=1745504075","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3642810?t=1745504075","capsule_image":"https://shar